Base: predicted 121/121, CRIMEP_CONTROL=OK.

JOINT / DISCLOSED cells considered and NOT built (judged clause (e) or covered):
  * re-arm at TIME / INTSTAT / INTMASK / REV keyed on a WRITE: those arms' bodies do not test writeflag -> joint, (e).
  * 2W landing keyed on bit 1 SET: no keeps-rowed 2W store has bit 1 set, but a single-axis bit-1 landing is caught by
    sb +0x37 (1W) -> only the width x bit joint escapes, (e).  Recorded as a falsity in the "carried both ways by each
    kind" sentence, not as a gap.
  * pre-set in the 8R branch keyed on bit 4 clear (both 8R pre-refusal accesses, +0x38 and +0x210, have bit 4 set):
    branch x bit joint, (e).
  * an accepted READ at +0x08 shrunk away: +0x08 is not in the rowed accept-offset list -> DISCLOSED (interior slot).

Expected CHANNEL: every survivor above varies ONLY the announce COUNT (M1-M8, M12), the ANSWER value (M9, M11) or a
landing read back by an accepted ld (M10) -- the channels the contract names; the survival is a missing CELL, never a
missing channel.
